{'symbol': 'CDAY', 'date': '2021-01-27 02:00:00', 'title': 'HENKEL CHOOSES CERIDIAN TO DRIVE VALUE AND INNOVATION AT SCALE', 'text': 'DÜSSELDORF, GERMANY, JAN. 27, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- CERIDIAN (NYSE: CDAY; TSX: CDAY), A GLOBAL LEADER IN HUMAN CAPITAL MANAGEMENT (HCM), TODAY ANNOUNCED HENKEL, A GLOBAL INDUSTRIAL AND CONSUMER GOODS LEADER, HAS SELECTED CERIDIAN AND THE DAYFORCE PLATFORM TO DELIVER ITS PAYROLL AND WORKFORCE MANAGEMENT NEEDS, WITH IMPLEMENTATION CURRENTLY UNDERWAY IN INDIA, MIDDLE EAST, AFRICA, AND SLOVENIA. HENKEL IS ACCELERATING DIGITALIZATION ACROSS ALL OPERATIONS, INCLUDING HUMAN RESOURCES, AS PART OF A COMPANY-WIDE INITIATIVE.'}